OL,3,GNEWSATown's lack of EV chargers puts   
OL,4,Aoff drivers - councillor               
OL,6,FA town's lack of charging facilities is
OL,7,Fdiscouraging drivers from owning       
OL,8,Felectric vehicles (EVs), a councillor  
OL,9,Fhas said.                              
OL,11,FEmily Young, a councillor in Alton,    
OL,12,FHampshire, said four chargers were     
OL,13,Fsupposed to have been installed at a   
OL,14,FLidl supermarket when it opened in     
OL,15,F2023.                                  
OL,17,FShe said another charger in the town   
OL,18,Fcentre had been broken since 2022,     
OL,19,Fwhile four EV stations at the          
OL,20,Fedge-of-town Alton Sports Centre were  
OL,21,Fonly recently repaired.                
