OL,3,GNEWSATown's lack of EV chargers puts   
OL,4,Aoff drivers - councillor               
OL,6,FLidl referred a BBC inquiry to its     
OL,7,Flandlord The Hargreaves Group, which   
OL,8,Fdid not immediately respond.           
